# Predicted versus natively measured change of a consumer under one edit; the session stays put.
until L1.a
break L*.p
whatif L1.m=0.5 add consumer=M[4,9]
whatif L0.v=0.25 add consumer=t3.logits[i=7]
whatif L1.o 1.5 scale consumer=L1.h_out
whatif L1.m=0.5 add consumer=t4.M[4,9]
where
whatif L1.m = 0.5 add --consumer M[4,9]
